      "decision_index": 32,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Playing Forest before Sazh's Chocobo means missing a landfall trigger. If Chocobo were cast first (for G from an untapped Forest), then the Forest played as a land drop, the Chocobo would get a +1/+1 counter from landfall, becoming a 1/2 instead of a 0/1. The remaining mana would still be sufficient to cast Badgermole Cub.",
      "action_taken": "Played Forest as the first action, before casting any creatures.",
