    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "At 10 life facing 8+ power on board (Surrak 4/3 trample, Badgermole Cub 2/2, Llanowar Elves 2/2), casting a 4-mana enchantment that does nothing immediately is risky. Opponent can attack for a large chunk of life next turn. While Leyline sets up powerful synergies with Dreadmaw's Ire and Full Bore, the defensive situation is precarious.",
